# ⚠️ `.claude/agents/gsd-*.md` deliberately NOT listed here — it does not work.
# Tested 2026-08-12: a path matched by .chezmoiignore is excluded from the target
# state entirely, so .chezmoiremove never fires on it. Ignore wins over remove.
# (Proof: `.omx` above — not ignored — was removed correctly by the same apply
# that left all 31 gsd agents untouched.)
# The gsd agents were therefore removed by hand on each box, and the
# .chezmoiignore rule is what keeps `chezmoi apply` from recreating them.
# Permanent fix, when convenient: git rm dot_claude/agents/gsd-*.md from the
# source, then both that ignore rule and this note can go.

